name: fiebre hemorrágica de Chapare
def: "A viral infectious disease that is a hemorrhagic fever, has_material_basis_in Chapare virus (Mammarenavirus chapareense). The infection has symptom headache, has symptom joint pain, has symptom muscle pain, has symptom vomiting, has symptom shock, and has symptom bleeding." [url:http\://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/sites/entrez/18421377]
