name: fiebre hemorrágica de Lujo
def: "A viral infectious disease that results_in infection, has_material_basis_in Lujo virus (Mammarenavirus lujoense), which has_symptom fever, has_symptom headache, has_symptom myalgia, has_symptom thrombocytopenia, and has_symptom bleeding. Bleeding is minor and not a prominent symptom." [url:https\://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lujo_virus, url:https\://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC2866397/, url:https\://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC4230886/, url:https\://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/19478873/, url:https\://www.cdc.gov/lujo-fever/about/index.html]
