def: "A developmental and epileptic encephalopathy that is characterized by severe infantile epilepsy, developmental delay, and intellectual disability and that has_material_basis_in heterozygous mutation in the BAIAP2 gene on chromosome 17q25." [url:https\://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/41133935/]
xref: MIM:621468
is_a: DOID:0050736 ! enfermedad autosómica dominante
