[Term]
id: DOID:0051090
name: developmental and epileptic encephalopathy 121
def: "A developmental and epileptic encephalopathy that is characterized by neonatal- or infantile-onset epilepsy, global developmental delay or intellectual disability, and death in infancy, childhood, or early adulthood and that has_material_basis_in homozygous mutation in the LGI1 gene on chromosome 10q23." [url:https\://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/40455867/]
xref: MIM:621475
is_a: DOID:0050737 ! enfermedad autosómica recesiva
