[Term]
id: DOID:0051098
name: retinitis pigmentosa 107
def: "A retinitis pigmentosa that is charaterized by onset of RP ranging from the second decade to the sixth decade of life, with affected individuals experiencing night blindness, constriction of peripheral vision, and reduced visual acuity and that has_material_basis_in homozygous or compound heterozygous mutation in the CFAP20 gene on chromosome 16q21." [url:https\://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/35246562/, url:https\://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/36329026/]
xref: MIM:621587
