[Term]
id: DOID:0060042
name: autismo atípico
def: "An autism spectrum disorder that involves some autistic symptoms occurring after age 3 with an absence of all the traits necessary for a diagnosis of autism." [url:http\://counsellingresource.com/distress/autistic/autism-atypical.html, url:https\://kidsbrainhealth.ca, url:https\://www.thehealthboard.com/what-is-atypical-autism.htm]
is_a: DOID:0060041 ! trastorno del espectro autista

[Term]
id: DOID:0060043
name: trastorno de la salud sexual
def: "Enfermedad de la salud mental que implica la alteración del funcionamiento sexual normal." [url:https\://my.clevelandclinic.org/health/diseases/9121-sexual-dysfunction]
is_a: DOID:150 ! enfermedad de salud mental

[Term]
id: DOID:0060044
name: trastorno parafílico
def: "Trastorno sexual que se caracteriza por fantasías, impulsos o comportamientos sexuales recurrentes e intensos que generalmente implican objetos no humanos." [url:https\://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Paraphilia]
is_a: DOID:0060043 ! trastorno de la salud sexual

[Term]
id: DOID:0060045
name: Munchausen por poder
def: "Trastorno facticio que implica la exageración deliberada, la fabricación y/o la inducción de problemas físicos, psicológicos, de comportamiento y/o de salud mental en otras personas." [url:http\://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Munchausen_by_proxy]
is_a: DOID:1766 ! trastorno facticio

[Term]
id: DOID:0060046
name: afasia
def: "A language disorder that involves an acquired impairment of any language modality such as producing or comprehending spoken or written language." [url:http\://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aphasia]
xref: MESH:D001037
is_a: DOID:93 ! trastorno del lenguaje
property_value: skos:exactMatch "MESH:D001037" xsd:string

