def: "A syndrome characterized by early infantile onset of hypotonia, feeding difficulties, poor overall growth, dysmorphic facies, profound developmental delay, and recurrent upper and lower respiratory infections associated with agammaglobulinemia that has_material_basis_in homozygous mutation in the SEL1L gene on chromosome 14q31." [url:https\://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/37943617/]
