name: miopatía congénita 4A
def: "A congenital myopathy that is characterized by skeletal muscle weakness, particularly in the muscles of the shoulders, upper arms, hips, and thighs." [url:https\://ghr.nlm.nih.gov/condition/congenital-fiber-type-disproportion]
synonym: "desproporción congénita tipo fibra" EXACT []
