[Term]
id: DOID:0080311
name: trastorno del desarrollo intelectual sindrómico ligado al cromosoma X de tipo Billuart
def: "A syndromic X-linked intellectual disability characterized by moderately to severely impaired intellectual development, cerebellar hypoplasia, and seizures that has_material_basis_in mutation in the oligophrenin-1 gene on chromosome Xq12." [url:https\://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/20528889/, url:https\://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/16158428]
