[Term]
id: DOID:0081304
name: Astrocitoma de alto grado con rasgos piloides
def: "An anaplastic astrocytoma that is characterized by high-grade piloid and/or glioblastoma-like histological features. It may occur anywhere in the central nervous system but most often arises in the posterior fossa." [url:https\://radiopaedia.org/articles/high-grade-astrocytoma-with-piloid-features-1?lang=us, url:https\://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC8131327/]
