synonym: "Fibrosis pulmonar idiopática, forma aguda mortal" EXACT []
synonym: "neumonitis intersticial aguda" EXACT []
synonym: "neumonía intersticial acelerada" EXACT []
synonym: "Síndrome de Hamman-Rich" EXACT []
