name: nódulo del ordeñador
def: "A viral infectious disease that results_in infection of cattle and humans, located_in skin, has_material_basis_in Pseudocowpox virus (Parapoxvirus pseudocowpox), which is transmitted_by contact with the infected cow teats, or transmitted_by fomites. The infection results_in_formation_of lesions on the fingers, hands, and forearms and has_symptom fever, has_symptom lymphangitis, and has_symptom lymphadenopathy." [url:http\://www.cfsph.iastate.edu/FastFacts/pdfs/pseudocowpox_F.pdf, url:https\://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC3945082/]
